    "fromLine": 17,
    "toLine": 17,
    "text": "该座位播放吃动画，并播放吃的方言语音；播完自动隐藏",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-028",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化-操作区",
    "fromLine": 18,
    "toLine": 18,
    "text": "收起吃碰杠胡按钮，隐藏多吃/多杠选择，清掉文字提示",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-029",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化-副露区",
    "fromLine": 19,
    "toLine": 19,
    "text": "从来源玩家河牌移除被吃的那张；吃者副露区增加这组牌；刷新副露来源箭头；手牌重排；重刷财神颜色",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-030",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
