    "fromLine": 20,
    "toLine": 20,
    "text": "自己托管时收起操作区、清提示、恢复手牌可点状态",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-031",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "二、界面变化-听牌界面（别人吃）",
    "fromLine": 21,
    "toLine": 21,
    "text": "别人吃时刷新听牌列表的剩余张数",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-032",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响-1",
    "fromLine": 25,
    "toLine": 25,
    "text": "被吃的牌来自出牌区；不是自己吃时，吃走的三张从自己记牌器扣除，否则听牌剩余张数会偏大",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-033",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响-2",
    "fromLine": 26,
    "toLine": 26,
    "text": "吃后手牌出现三缺一的待出状态，但不是单放，出牌限制的置灰逻辑对此有专门处理",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-034",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "三、连带影响-3",
    "fromLine": 27,
    "toLine": 27,
    "text": "吃/碰累计摊数由服务端另行下发（三摊更新），本消息不参与",
    "mandatory": true
  },
  {
    "ruleId": "R02-035",
    "file": ".claude/skills/game-prd-check/references/rules/hzmj_game_flow_handler/hzmj_game_flow_handler/10-吃.md",
    "section": "四、重连/回放",
    "fromLine": 31,
    "toLine": 31,
    "text": "只记录状态、副露、最后出牌与记牌器，不播放吃动画、不改操作区",
    "mandatory": true
  },
